{"unit_id": "tag:03JB:statement", "translation": "考虑由概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphisms）所成的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n若<MATH_0002>的纤维普遍有界（universally bounded fibres），且<MATH_0003>是满射（surjective）且平坦（flat）的，则<MATH_0004>也具有纤维普遍有界（universally bounded fibres）的性质。更确切地说，若<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>的各纤维（fibres）的度数（degree）的上界，则<MATH_0007>也是<MATH_0008>的各纤维（fibres）的度数（degree）的上界。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "universally bounded fibres", "target_term": "纤维普遍有界"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "universally bounded fibres", "target_term": "纤维普遍有界"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度数"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度数"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指交换图中的对象"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指组成交换图的箭头"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "指引理中所考察的图表"}, {"source_term": "universally bounded fibres", "target_term": "纤维普遍有界", "context": "给出第一个态射的纤维有界性假设"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "给出另一个态射的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "给出另一个态射的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "universally bounded fibres", "target_term": "纤维普遍有界", "context": "给出推得的纤维有界性"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "指度数已有上界的各纤维"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度数", "context": "指假设中有上界的量"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "指度数得到上界的各纤维"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度数", "context": "指结论中有上界的量"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03JB:proof", "translation": "假设<MATH_0001>的纤维普遍有界（universally bounded fibres），且<MATH_0002>是满射（surjective）且平坦（flat）的。设<MATH_0003>的各纤维（fibres）的度数（degree）以<MATH_0004>为上界。我们断言<MATH_0005>也可作为<MATH_0006>的相应上界。\n设<MATH_0007>。考虑概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>。它是平坦（flat）且满射（surjective）的。由假设，<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>上的有限（finite）概形（scheme），特别地，它是一个阿廷（Artinian）环（ring）的谱（spectrum）（由代数（Algebra）一章的引理<REF_0001>得出）。\n由引理<REF_0002>，态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>是仿射（affine）的，特别地，它是拟紧（quasi-compact）的。由引理<REF_0003>，<MATH_0012>是有限（finite）且离散（discrete）的，因为<MATH_0013>具有这一性质。\n因此<MATH_0014>是仿射概形（affine scheme）（这是一道很好的练习。例如，也可以将性质（Properties）一章的引理<REF_0004>应用于由<MATH_0015>的所有点（points）组成的集合（set），从而得出这一结论）。\n记<MATH_0016>和<MATH_0017>。则<MATH_0018>在<MATH_0019>上忠实平坦（faithfully flat），从而<MATH_0020>。因此<MATH_0021>，这正是所需的结论。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "universally bounded fibres", "target_term": "纤维普遍有界"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度数"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Artinian", "target_term": "阿廷"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "universally bounded fibres", "target_term": "纤维普遍有界", "context": "指证明开头给定的纤维性质"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "指同时假设的满射性"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "指同时假设的平坦性"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "指假设中已有度数上界的纤维"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "度数", "context": "指受所给上界约束的量"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指随后考察的态射的源与靶"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指随后考察的态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "指这个态射具有的第一项性质"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "指这个态射具有的第二项性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "指概形在给定基底上的性质"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指假设间接描述的几何对象"}, {"source_term": "Artinian", "target_term": "阿廷", "context": "指取谱的环具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指取谱的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "描述由该环所得的概形"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指出所引引理所属的章"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指由所引引理判定为仿射的态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "指由引理得到的态射性质"}, {"source_term": "quasi-compact", "target_term": "拟紧", "context": "指由仿射性得到的性质"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "指所推出的有限性"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散", "context": "指与有限性一同推出的拓扑性质"}, {"source_term": "affine scheme", "target_term": "仿射概形", "context": "指由前述性质得到的概形类型"}, {"source_term": "Properties", "target_term": "性质", "context": "指出另一种证明所引引理所属的章"}, {"source_term": "points", "target_term": "点", "context": "指应用引理时收集的各点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指由所给概形的全部点组成的集合"}, {"source_term": "fait