{"unit_id": "tag:0H1M:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是一个点（point）。假设<MATH_0003>是约化（reduced）的，且<MATH_0004>在集合（set）意义下包含于（contained）<MATH_0005>。则<MATH_0006>经由典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0007>分解（factors through）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "contained", "target_term": "包含于"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指所给态射的源和靶"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指引理给定的态射"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "指引理给定的点"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化", "context": "指所假设的概形性质"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "限定包含关系仅就集合而言"}, {"source_term": "contained", "target_term": "包含于", "context": "指两个给定对象之间假设的集合包含关系"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指结论中用来分解的态射"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解", "context": "指给定态射经由典范态射分解"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0H1M:proof", "translation": "证明略。提示如下。作仿射（affine）局部考察，可归结为一个交换代数（commutative algebra）引理。给定环同态（ring map）<MATH_0001>，其中<MATH_0002>是约化（reduced）的，且恰有一个素（prime）理想（ideal）<MATH_0003>属于<MATH_0004>的像（image），则<MATH_0005>经由<MATH_0006>分解（factors through）。这是一道很好的练习。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "commutative algebra", "target_term": "交换代数"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "限定局部考察所用的情形"}, {"source_term": "commutative algebra", "target_term": "交换代数", "context": "指归约后引理所属的领域"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环同态", "context": "指代数引理给定的映射"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "约化", "context": "指代数引理对给定环施加的性质"}, {"source_term": "prime", "target_term": "素", "context": "限定理想的类型"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "指在像中唯一存在的对象"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像", "context": "指包含该理想的映射像"}, {"source_term": "factors through", "target_term": "分解", "context": "指结论中给定映射的分解关系"}], "notes": []}
